		["{npc:1965} guards the tunnel out of the valley, east of {area:77}; {npc:6782} stands beside him at its mouth."] = "{npc:1965} guarda el túnel de salida del valle, al este de {area:77}; {npc:6782} está a su lado, en la boca.",
